{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんこんばんは！新内眞衣です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日おとといは\n全国ツアー@仙台でした(^-^)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2016/08/16/7701813/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仙台は美味しいものがありすぎて\n誘惑と戦うのが大変だったな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"VS牛タン\nVSずんだ餅\nVS萩の月\nVSずんだシェイク"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"etc..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見事に全敗です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラジオを聴いてくれてる方は\nお察しの通りです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次は福岡の乱か...\n豚骨ラーメン\n通りもん\n明太子\n負ける気しかしない..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと２公演！\n来てくれる方は楽しみましょう♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2016/08/16/7701813/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初ずんだシェイクが\n美味しすぎた..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎写真集"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今更ながら写真集オフショット〜\nグアム楽しかったな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2016/08/16/7701813/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2016/08/16/7701813/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"南の島は30代後半でまた行きたいな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1時間遅れのI love you.\n是非よろしくお願いします♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ANN0"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先週もありがとうございました！\nお知らせした通り浴衣回！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せっかく浴衣を着たのに\n内容で浴衣に１mmも触れない\n作家さん仕事ぶりたるや◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラジオじゃ伝わらないから\n自ら言ったよね。ﾊｽﾞｶｼｲﾖﾈ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもみなさんから好評だったから\n着て良かったです〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつだかの握手会でも着るので\nお楽しみに〜m(_ _)m"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは今週も\nスタッフさんブログ\nhttp://www.allnightnippon.com/program/zero/wed/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"番組メールアドレス\nnogizaka@allnightnippon.com"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"LINE LIVEのおまけコーナー\nhttps://live.line.me/r/channels/231/upcoming/8126"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来週もよろしくお願いしますm(_ _)m"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お知らせ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎7/23発売 　B.L.T.\n◎7/23発売　 月刊ザテレビジョン\n◎7/24公開　 乃木坂ゴルフ倶楽部♯25\nhttp://video.rakuten.co.jp/content/151331/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎8/5 １時間遅れのI love you.\n◎8/5 のぎ天 キャンプ回\nhttp://video.rakuten.co.jp/content/186506/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎毎週水曜　深夜3時〜\n乃木坂46 新内眞衣のANN０\n#AM1242\n#FM93.0\n#LINE LIVE"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは今日はこの辺で\nおしまいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏らしいことをもっとしたい私。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今もっともしたい夏らしいことは\n手持ち花火です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誰か誘ってください...笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2016/08/16/7701813/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"巨大ドーナツ食べ放題でも可◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また書きます。"}],"source":"archive"}